# Binary file handling
#
# The rule here: anything a build reads must be a normal git object, never LFS.
#
# This repository previously tracked every binary extension in LFS, generated
# from a boilerplate list. That put the logo, the vehicle photographs, the Geist
# fonts, the Android launcher icons and the Gradle wrapper jar behind a filter
# that only resolves when the checkout has git-lfs installed AND the objects
# were uploaded. Railway's builder has neither guarantee, so production served
# 130-byte pointer stubs where the images and fonts should have been — Vite,
# seeing files that small, inlined the pointer *text* as data URIs. The site had
# no images and no fonts and reported no error anywhere.
#
# Total weight of everything that was in LFS: 1.7 MB across 45 files. LFS buys
# nothing at that size and costs a silent production failure, so build inputs
# are plain objects now, marked `binary` so Windows checkouts cannot corrupt
# them with line-ending conversion.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build inputs — plain git objects, never LFS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png                binary
*.jpg                binary
*.jpeg               binary
*.gif                binary
*.ico                binary
*.webp               binary
*.bmp                binary

*.woff               binary
*.woff2              binary
*.ttf                binary
*.otf                binary
*.eot                binary

*.jar                binary
*.wasm               binary

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Genuinely large media — LFS is appropriate, and no build reads these
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mp4                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mov                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.avi                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mkv                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.webm               filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mp3                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.wav                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.flac               filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

*.psd                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.ai                 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.sketch             filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tiff               filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tif                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

*.iso                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.dmg                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.7z                 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.rar                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

*.safetensors        filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.gguf               filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.onnx               filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pt                 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pth                filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.h5                 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.parquet            filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Text that must not be normalized
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bat                text eol=crlf
gradlew              text eol=lf
